    calculator_allowed: true,
    question_text: 'Two gyms, A and B, share 1000 members between them. Each month 15% of gym A’s members move to gym B, and 10% of gym B’s members move to gym A. No other members join or leave. At the start, gym A has 600 members and gym B has 400.',
